a real steady push on that penetrometer; but you can see I pushed on it two   
or three times."]                                                             
                                                                              
[Jones - "It's tall enough that you couldn't really lean on it."]             
                                                                              
[Duke - "Well, that's what I was trying to do. You see? There's a push.       
There's another push. I was trying to get on top of it. And then another      
push. Another one."]                                                          
                                                                              
[Jones - "So this is mostly arm force, rather than body weight."]             
                                                                              
